#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC106.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC4.rude:18
msgid "Nothing.  Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Nichts.  Entschuldigt die Störung."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC107.rude:1
msgid ""
"These are dangerous times.  If I were you, I'd get myself a lucky troll's tongue!"
msgstr ""
"Das sind gefährliche Zeiten.  An Eurer Stelle würde ich mir eine glückbringende Trollzunge besorgen!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC107.rude:3
msgid ""
"Verhoffin was an evil, evil man!  If it weren't for him, who knows what wonders we would have today!"
msgstr ""
"Verhoffin war ein böser, böser Mann!  Wäre er nicht gewesen, wer weiß, welche Wunder wir heute hätten!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC107.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC4.rude:12
msgid "What do you know about the Great Cataclysm?"
msgstr "Was wißt Ihr über den Großen Sturm der Elemente?"

